        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nHooke & MacDonald are delighted to present this spacious and well-appointed Two-bedroom family home extending to approximately - 86 sq.m to the market.\n\nSet over two floors, the property offers modern living in a mature and highly accessible residential area, making it an ideal choice for first-time buyers, families, or investors. Upon entering the house, you are welcomed by a bright entrance hallway featuring a guest WC. To the left lies a generous spacious open-plan kitchen and dining area, which has access to the main living area at the rear complete with direct access to the private back garden-ideal for outdoor dining and family gatherings.\n \nUpstairs, the first floor comprises a large master bedroom to the front of the property with a private en-suite, one additional bedroom to the rear, a main family bathroom, a hot press, and an additional storage space.\n \nFinglas is a vibrant and well-established suburb located just 7 km from Dublin City Centre. The area boasts excellent transport links, including multiple Dublin Bus routes (such as the 9, 40, 83, and 140) and easy access to the M50 and M2 motorways, ensuring swift connectivity to the city and beyond. Dublin Airport is also within a 20-minute drive.\n \nFamilies will appreciate the abundance of educational facilities, with a wide selection of primary and secondary schools in the vicinity, including St. Canice' s, St. Brigid' s, Gaelscoil U Earcin, and Coliste Eoin. Local amenities are plentiful, with Finglas Village offering a range of shops, cafes, and services. Nearby shopping centres include Charlestown Shopping Centre-home to an Odeon cinema, Leisureplex, and various retail outlets-and Clearwater Shopping Centre. Recreational facilities are also abundant, with Tolka Valley Park providing scenic green spaces for outdoor activities. This property combines comfortable living with exceptional convenience, making it a must-see for those seeking a quality home in a thriving community.\n \n*Viewings are arranged by appointment only*"
      },
